  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to support the employability of marginalized youth, by developing the capacity of local institutions and NGOs to provide targeted training for marginalized youth on vocational and employment skills in two pilot governorates, and bybuilding partnerships across these providers.</narrative>
